meta {
  name: Get Shared Care Document (no auth)
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{protocol}}://{{host}}:{{port}}/{{apiPrefix}}er-brief/shared/{{token}}/files/{{fileId}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  Unauthenticated, like Get Shared Brief — a clinician opening a shared link has no account. Valid
  only for file ids frozen into this snapshot's `fileIds` at creation: an unknown token, an expired
  one, and a file that was not frozen into this snapshot all answer the identical 404
  SNAPSHOT_NOT_FOUND, so a valid token gives no signal to probe other files with.

  Run "Create Snapshot" first (on a patient with a care document on file) to populate {{token}}.
}
